{
  "key": 3454,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000471_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Help, help, Trainer!\n",
        "Please, I want to see my papa.\r",
        "My papa and I lived at the Valley\n",
        "Windworks.\r",
        "But then a whole bunch of people\n",
        "dressed like spacemen came...\r",
        "They kicked me out, and they’re making\n",
        "my papa do something.\r",
        "Please, Trainer!\n",
        "I miss my papa!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000471_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Please, Trainer! I want to see my papa.\n",
        "He’s at the Valley Windworks..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000471_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "We, Team Galactic, are conducting\n",
        "research in the Eterna Forest!\r",
        "This is as far as you will go!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000471_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Our research involves catching Pokémon\n",
        "in the flowery meadows of Floaroma.\r",
        "We are also covertly stealing the\n",
        "energy of the Valley Windworks.\r",
        "But that is of no concern to you!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000471_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Our research involves catching Pokémon\n",
        "in the flowery meadows of Floaroma.\r",
        "We are also covertly stealing the\n",
        "energy of the Valley Windworks.\r",
        "But that is of no concern to you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000471_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Many Poison-type Pokémon make the\n",
        "Eterna Forest their home.\r",
        "But I didn’t buy any Antidotes.\n",
        "What should I do?\f",
        "Do I press on, or do I go back?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000471_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "If you slather sweet Honey on\n",
        "a sweet-smelling tree...\r",
        "Pokémon may be attracted by that\n",
        "sweet scent."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000471_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Rt. 205\n",
        "Floaroma Town"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000471_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Rt. 205\n",
        "Eterna Forest"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000471_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainer Tips!\r",
        "The items placed in your Bag are\n",
        "automatically sorted to the\f",
        "appropriate pockets.\r",
        "It’s very convenient!\n",
        "It’s a Trainer’s best friend!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route205South_Text_Arc2WaitingAtWindworks",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth and Cyrus are waiting inside\n",
        "the Valley Windworks."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route205South_Text_QuestsBuzz",
      "en_US": [
        "The Resonator gives a faint buzz.\r",
        "By the fence, a Minun is scratching\n",
        "at a crate."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route205South_Text_QuestsMinunPaws",
      "en_US": [
        "Minun: Minu! Minuu!\r",
        "It keeps pawing at the crate."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route205South_Text_QuestsCrate",
      "en_US": [
        "A crate stamped with a black sun.\n",
        "It must have fallen off a truck.\r",
        "Something inside is scratching back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route205South_Text_QuestsCrateBuzz",
      "en_US": [
        "The Resonator buzzes against the\n",
        "wood.\r",
        "Little sparks snap between the\n",
        "slats."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route205South_Text_QuestsOpenCrate",
      "en_US": "Pry the crate open?"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route205South_Text_QuestsNoRoom",
      "en_US": [
        "There's no room in your party for\n",
        "two more Pokémon.\r",
        "These two shouldn't be split up\n",
        "again.\r",
        "Come back with two free spaces."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route205South_Text_QuestsPlusleTumbled",
      "en_US": "A Plusle tumbled out of the crate!"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route205South_Text_QuestsPairCries",
      "en_US": [
        "Plusle: Plu! Plusle!\n",
        "Minun: Minu! Minuu!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route205South_Text_QuestsWontLetGo",
      "en_US": [
        "The two of them won't let go of\n",
        "each other."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route205South_Text_QuestsLookingAtYou",
      "en_US": [
        "...Now they're both looking at you.\r",
        "Plusle and Minun want to come\n",
        "with you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route205South_Text_QuestsReceivedPair",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "Plusle and Minun!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
